    <briefdescription>
<para>Visualization and runtime configuration for a session. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1SessionOptions" kindref="compound">SessionOptions</ref> describes the objects that configure how a session is visualized. It contains the available cameras, filters, scenes, and scene layout, together with the optional path to a detector geometry description.</para>
<para>The objects referenced by this class are shared through <computeroutput>std::shared_ptr</computeroutput> because the same visualization object may be referenced by multiple parts of the visualization system.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1Session" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::Session</ref> </para>
